> > > > site and year, so you have actually quite a bit more information to make
> > > > this test than just the 32 sites. When you said you played around with the
> > > > Guillera-Arroita and Lahoz-Monfort power analysis, it's not clear whether
> > > > the model for that was consistent with the actual model you're using. If
> > > > not, you should just repeat the power analysis for your exact model for a
> > > > better assessment of your specific design.
> > > > regards
> > > > andy
