> > >> levels of repeated samples within a site: frogs, visits, and tests. I'm not
> > >> sure what these represent exactly, but I think this is one more level of
> > >> organization than goccu can handle. It can only handle two levels: primary
> > >> periods, and secondary periods within primary periods.
